{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o067a","title":"赦死罪曹丕广陵望江而还","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o067a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"赦死罪曹丕广陵望江而还","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o067a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"观江退还","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o067a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":224,"label":"秋八月至九月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y224","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o066","basis":"秋八月至九月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o067a-q","wuzhu-q-o066","houfei-q-o038","houfei-q-b-4f3492a2a614a7fb6301"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o067a-q","source_order":[47,359,"O067a"],"order":8252}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-b-4f3492a2a614a7fb6301","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-4f3492a2a614a7fb6301","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗五年：黄初五年（公元 224 ）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-da0e639fdf857f1cccce","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o038","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-10fa24c108af165ad605","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖4〗，帝东征，后留许昌永始台。时霖雨百余日，城楼多坏，有司奏请移止。后曰：“昔楚昭王出游〖5〗，贞姜留渐台〖6〗；江水至，使者迎而无符〖7〗，不去，卒没。今帝在远，吾幸未有是患；而便移止，奈何〖8〗？”群臣莫敢复言。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o067a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-5ff13a79ef813922a667","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，赦死罪。九月，魏文帝出广陵，望大江。曰：“彼有人焉，未可图也！”乃还。﹝五﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o066","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-adff9cb83c11e6985e1e","layer":"original","quote":"三年夏〖9〗，遣辅义中郎将张温，聘于蜀〖10〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":357,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
